@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:accessibility] app-screen-text-increase
At default text preferences, app screen text MUST increase by 0.125rem from its original size,
without changing the root rem size, spacing scale, font families or weights.

@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:product] preserve-document-typography
The app text increase MUST NOT change prescription preview, print or PDF typography.
Prescription source, paginated preview and browser-print roots MUST retain their original text scale.
